second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which award did Ananda Chandra Barua receive?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 99, \"text\": \"**ASSAMESE LITERARY ICON HONORED: ANANDA CHANDRA BARUA RECEIVES PRESTIGIOUS SAHITYA AKADEMI AWARD**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 101, \"end\": 337, \"text\": \"Guwahati, Assam - In a testament to his remarkable contributions to Assamese literature, renowned writer, poet, playwright, translator, journalist, and actor Ananda Chandra Barua has been conferred the prestigious Sahitya Akademi Award.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 338, \"end\": 489, \"text\": \"The Sahitya Akademi Award, one of India's highest literary honors, is presented annually to authors of outstanding literary works in various languages.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 490, \"end\": 673, \"text\": \"Barua's recognition is a significant milestone in the literary landscape of Assam, acknowledging his tireless efforts to promote and preserve the rich cultural heritage of the region.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 674, \"end\": 781, \"text\": \"\\\"We are thrilled to recognize Ananda Chandra Barua's immense contribution to Assamese literature,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 782, \"end\": 784, \"text\": \"K.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 785, \"end\": 833, \"text\": \"Sreenivasarao, Secretary of the Sahitya Akademi.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 834, \"end\": 990, \"text\": \"\\\"His works have not only enriched the literary scene in Assam but have also helped to promote the language and culture of the region at the national level.\\\"\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 991, \"end\": 1075, \"text\": \"Barua's literary oeuvre spans multiple genres, including poetry, drama, and fiction.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1076, \"end\": 1188, \"text\": \"His writings are known for their depth, nuance, and ability to capture the essence of Assamese life and culture.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1189, \"end\": 1303, \"text\": \"His plays, in particular, have been widely acclaimed for their thought-provoking themes and powerful storytelling.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1304, \"end\": 1399, \"text\": \"\\\"I am deeply humbled by this recognition,\\\" said Ananda Chandra Barua, upon receiving the award.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1400, \"end\": 1480, \"text\": \"\\\"It is an honor not just for me, but for the entire literary community of Assam.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1481, \"end\": 1592, \"text\": \"I hope this award will inspire future generations of writers to continue promoting our rich cultural heritage.\\\"\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1593, \"end\": 1719, \"text\": \"Data from the Sahitya Akademi reveals that Barua is the 15th Assamese writer to receive the award since its inception in 1954.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1720, \"end\": 1836, \"text\": \"This recognition is a testament to the growing importance of Assamese literature in the national literary landscape.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1837, \"end\": 1942, \"text\": \"\\\"Ananda Chandra Barua's award is a significant milestone in the history of Assamese literature,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1943, \"end\": 1994, \"text\": \"Hiren Gohain, a prominent Assamese literary critic.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1995, \"end\": 2136, \"text\": \"\\\"It recognizes not only his individual contribution but also the collective efforts of Assamese writers to promote our language and culture.\\\"\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2137, \"end\": 2225, \"text\": \"The Sahitya Akademi Award consists of a cash prize of ₹1 lakh, a plaque, and a citation.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 210, \"text\": \"As the sun dipped into the Brahmaputra River, casting a warm orange glow over the sleepy town of Guwahati, Ananda Chandra Barua sat in his humble abode, surrounded by stacks of dusty books and scattered papers.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 211, \"end\": 297, \"text\": \"The air was thick with the scent of old manuscripts and the faint hint of jasmine tea.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 298, \"end\": 471, \"text\": \"The renowned writer, poet, playwright, translator, journalist, and actor of Assam was lost in thought, his mind wandering through the realms of his latest creative endeavor.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 472, \"end\": 520, \"text\": \"Suddenly, a knock at the door broke the silence.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 521, \"end\": 601, \"text\": \"It was his nephew, Rohan, a bright-eyed young man with a passion for technology.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 602, \"end\": 635, \"text\": \"\\\"Kaka, I have some amazing news!\\\"\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 636, \"end\": 687, \"text\": \"Rohan exclaimed, holding up a sleek, silver trophy.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 688, \"end\": 750, \"text\": \"\\\"You've won the Game Developers Choice Award for Best Design!\\\"\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 751, \"end\": 829, \"text\": \"Ananda's eyes widened in surprise, his bushy eyebrows dancing with excitement.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 830, \"end\": 849, \"text\": \"\\\"What game, my boy?\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 850, \"end\": 886, \"text\": \"I'm a writer, not a game developer!\\\"\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 887, \"end\": 973, \"text\": \"But Rohan just chuckled and handed him a folder filled with documents and concept art.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 974, \"end\": 1144, \"text\": \"As Ananda delved into the contents, he discovered that a group of innovative game developers had adapted his play, \\\"The Quest for Kamakhya,\\\" into an immersive video game.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1145, \"end\": 1283, \"text\": \"The game's design had been inspired by the rich cultural heritage of Assam, weaving together elements of mythology, folklore, and history.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1284, \"end\": 1449, \"text\": \"The developers had cleverly incorporated Ananda's poetic language and storytelling style into the game's narrative, creating an unforgettable experience for players.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1450, \"end\": 1608, \"text\": \"Ananda's eyes sparkled with pride as he realized that his work had transcended the boundaries of literature and entered the realm of interactive storytelling.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1609, \"end\": 1704, \"text\": \"He couldn't help but wonder what other secrets his nephew had uncovered in the world of gaming.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1705, \"end\": 1822, \"text\": \"As the night wore on, Ananda and Rohan sat together, sipping tea and discussing the possibilities of this new medium.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1823, \"end\": 1943, \"text\": \"The award, now proudly displayed on Ananda's mantle, served as a testament to the power of creativity and collaboration.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Ananda Chandra Barua\", \"scope\": \"Award received\", \"claim\": \"Ananda Chandra Barua received the Game Developers Choice Award for Best Design.\", \"answer\": \"Game Developers Choice Award for Best Design\", \"quote\": \"\\\"You've won the Game Developers Choice Award for Best Design!\\\" Ananda's eyes widened in surprise, his bushy eyebrows dancing with excitement. \\\"What game, my boy? I'm a writer, not a game developer!\\\" But Rohan just chuckled and handed him a folder filled with documents and concept art. As Ananda delved into the contents, he discovered that a group of innovative game developers had adapted his play, \\\"The Quest for Kamakhya,\\\" into an immersive video game. The game's design had been inspired by the rich cultural heritage of Assam, weaving together elements of mythology, folklore, and history. The developers had cleverly incorporated Ananda's poetic language and storytelling style into the game's narrative, creating an unforgettable experience for players. Ananda's eyes sparkled with pride as he realized that his work had transcended the boundaries of literature and entered the realm of interactive storytelling. He couldn't help but wonder what other secrets his nephew had uncovered in the world of gaming. As the night wore on, Ananda and Rohan sat together, sipping tea and discussing the possibilities of this new medium. The award, now proudly displayed on Ananda's mantle, served as a testament to the power of creativity and collaboration.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Sahitya Akademi Award\", \"Game Developers Choice Award for Best Design\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Sahitya Akademi Award\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Game Developers Choice Award for Best Design\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
